1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Eighth Episode
The Bounty
Sapphire that Disappeared into the Sea

15
00:02:44,902 --> 00:02:45,575
It's me.

16
00:02:58,230 --> 00:02:59,700
Silence!

17
00:03:05,090 --> 00:03:09,300
Gentlemen, if you want to make a million yen, listen up!

18
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:10,460
A million yen?

19
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,720
A million yen!

20
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:13,980
You know the princess of Silverland.

21
00:03:14,505 --> 00:03:15,505
You mean Sapphire?

22
00:03:16,154 --> 00:03:20,920
That's right. Go kidnap Sapphire. Don't kill her. Just bring her to me.

23
00:03:22,283 --> 00:03:23,580
What for?

24
00:03:24,630 --> 00:03:26,811
I won't answer questions.

25
00:03:26,835 --> 00:03:30,140
A one-million-yen reward to whoever brings her by tomorrow morning.

26
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:38,471
Tonight, the castle's back gate is unguarded and unlocked.

27
00:03:38,495 --> 00:03:40,360
Good luck, gentlemen.

28
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:42,858
Hey, a million yen!

29
00:03:43,282 --> 00:03:44,680
That pays better than being pirates.

30
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:45,346
Count me in.

31
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,900
It's quiet... Too quiet!

32
00:04:06,830 --> 00:04:09,571
On a night like this, I feel like something bad is about to happen...

33
00:04:12,850 --> 00:04:14,920
Oh, Lord Sapphire, is something wrong?

34
00:04:15,624 --> 00:04:17,586
Oh, it's just you, Doctor Uranai!

35
00:04:17,890 --> 00:04:19,740
It is far too quiet, Lord Sapphire.

36
00:04:19,955 --> 00:04:21,580
I was just thinking the same thing.

37
00:04:21,930 --> 00:04:23,480
In the hallway on my way here...

38
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:26,160
Not a single guard was standing watch.

39
00:04:26,613 --> 00:04:28,233
Not a single one?

40
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:30,411
Guards!

41
00:04:31,209 --> 00:04:32,360
Are there no guards here?

42
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,319
Guards!

43
00:04:40,950 --> 00:04:41,980
Will this really work?

44
00:04:42,255 --> 00:04:44,673
It's my master plan. Just watch!

45
00:04:51,550 --> 00:04:53,673
Looks like the bounty is ours.

46
00:04:54,886 --> 00:04:55,886
Who are you?

47
00:04:56,215 --> 00:04:57,740
Who are <i>you</i>, showing up after us?

48
00:04:58,105 --> 00:04:59,358
Get them!

49
00:05:04,823 --> 00:05:06,660
We won't let you steal our bounty!

50
00:05:06,986 --> 00:05:08,040
Hurry up!

51
00:05:13,190 --> 00:05:16,060
You can leave the rest to us.

52
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,820
She's sound asleep.

53
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:34,618
Sapphire, you're awake?

54
00:05:34,642 --> 00:05:35,551
I knew you'd show up.

55
00:05:35,622 --> 00:05:36,746
Who are you?

56
00:05:36,930 --> 00:05:38,880
Since you're awake, we're doing this the rough way!

57
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,700
Just get into this sack quietly!

58
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:49,200
Blood! Is that you, Blood?

59
00:05:49,593 --> 00:05:53,540
It's Boss Blood! Did you come for the bounty, too?

60
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:59,613
Boss! Trying to hog it all for yourself?

61
00:05:59,786 --> 00:06:03,413
Thank you! But why are you here...? What bounty?

62
00:06:21,450 --> 00:06:23,481
Give me the reward for Sapphire as promised.

63
00:06:23,812 --> 00:06:25,441
It's definitely Sapphire...

64
00:06:25,465 --> 00:06:27,880
Here's my one million yen reward!

65
00:06:29,973 --> 00:06:30,780
Where am I?

66
00:06:30,815 --> 00:06:32,126
Oh, Blood!

67
00:06:32,235 --> 00:06:34,420
Wait, do you know each other?

68
00:06:35,690 --> 00:06:37,500
Why did you hit me all of a sudden?

69
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:39,300
And who on earth are these people?

70
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,760
No way. Don't address me so casually, Princess of Silverland. It's annoying.

71
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:48,180
Blood!

72
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:52,420
Now that I've got what I came for, I'm done here. See ya.

73
00:06:53,893 --> 00:06:54,853
Blood, wait!

74
00:06:55,055 --> 00:06:57,240
Wait, wait—you're staying right here.

75
00:06:57,340 --> 00:06:58,034
What?

76
00:06:58,698 --> 00:06:59,701
What on earth is going on?

77
00:06:59,898 --> 00:07:01,033
What happened?

78
00:07:02,310 --> 00:07:04,754
Hang in there for three days.

79
00:07:04,778 --> 00:07:05,820
Three days?

80
00:07:50,643 --> 00:07:51,860
What's with this explosion?!

81
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:56,413
There's something at the bottom of the sea.

82
00:09:17,379 --> 00:09:18,379
This is incredible!

83
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:40,626
Listen up, everyone! The explosion test was a success!

84
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,714
Transport all the finished gunpowder to

85
00:09:44,738 --> 00:09:47,820
Silverland's castle town by tomorrow night!

86
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:50,534
The day after tomorrow—

87
00:09:50,558 --> 00:09:52,834
the afternoon of the third day—

88
00:09:52,858 --> 00:09:55,640
we'll detonate the gunpowder and blow the city of Silverland to pieces!

89
00:09:56,199 --> 00:10:00,519
Now everyone, keep making more of this top-grade gunpowder!

90
00:10:11,239 --> 00:10:14,380
How's that? Looks just like the real decree, doesn't it?

91
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:17,246
Anyone would take it for real.

92
00:10:17,270 --> 00:10:19,640
Once this is posted, Sapphire takes all the blame!

93
00:10:19,875 --> 00:10:21,140
Precisely!

94
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,640
What does it say?

95
00:10:26,060 --> 00:10:28,066
<i>A grand amusement park shall be built for the children.</i>

96
00:10:28,090 --> 00:10:30,640
<i>All obstructing buildings will be demolished.</i>

97
00:10:30,664 --> 00:10:33,440
<i>Disobeyers will be executed immediately.</i>

98
00:10:33,665 --> 00:10:35,040
From Princess Sapphire?!

99
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:54,200
Our homes...

100
00:10:54,224 --> 00:10:56,120
How cruel...

101
00:10:56,144 --> 00:10:58,280
Is this really Princess Sapphire's order?

102
00:11:00,001 --> 00:11:02,573
Execution? Isn't that a bit extreme for an amusement park?

103
00:11:04,669 --> 00:11:06,820
What in the world is Princess Sapphire thinking?

104
00:11:41,740 --> 00:11:42,740
Sapphire!

105
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:44,680
Who's calling me?

106
00:11:46,109 --> 00:11:48,140
That was definitely Blood's voice!

107
00:11:49,333 --> 00:11:50,333
Quiet.

108
00:11:59,459 --> 00:12:02,120
It sounds noisy outside. What's going on?

109
00:12:06,659 --> 00:12:10,240
Lord Goll, this man was loitering in front of Sapphire's room.

110
00:12:11,679 --> 00:12:12,540
You're...

111
00:12:12,930 --> 00:12:15,240
Yep, it's me! Pirate Blood!

112
00:12:17,108 --> 00:12:18,326
Whoa, boss, hold on!

113
00:12:18,357 --> 00:12:22,520
Pirating wasn't paying off, so I snuck in here to change careers!

114
00:12:22,855 --> 00:12:23,855
Cut me some slack!

115
00:12:26,444 --> 00:12:27,075
Hey!

116
00:12:27,393 --> 00:12:28,599
Bring out Sapphire!

117
00:12:34,723 --> 00:12:35,693
X!

118
00:12:35,904 --> 00:12:37,760
So you really are part of the X-Union!

119
00:12:39,230 --> 00:12:42,853
What evil scheme are you plotting, bringing me here?!

120
00:12:43,395 --> 00:12:46,620
Just as the rumors say, she's quite feisty.

121
00:12:46,945 --> 00:12:49,920
Hey, Sapphire, do you know this man?

122
00:12:51,260 --> 00:12:52,166
Blood!

123
00:12:52,669 --> 00:12:54,500
Still, I'm glad you found this place.

124
00:12:54,524 --> 00:12:56,200
I really thought you'd betrayed me.

125
00:12:56,224 --> 00:12:57,880
Hey, how many times do I have to tell you?

126
00:12:57,904 --> 00:12:59,599
I don't know you. You've got the wrong guy.

127
00:13:01,363 --> 00:13:05,620
I can't get anything done with you butting in. Now back off! What a pain.

128
00:13:07,674 --> 00:13:08,481
Blood!

129
00:13:10,139 --> 00:13:12,580
I can't believe Blood would betray me after how close we were...

130
00:13:13,589 --> 00:13:14,786
Something terrible is happening...

131
00:13:14,810 --> 00:13:16,606
Someone! Open this door!

132
00:13:17,190 --> 00:13:18,240
Let me out!

133
00:13:18,939 --> 00:13:21,386
Princess of Silverland or not,

134
00:13:21,410 --> 00:13:22,706
I don't care about any of that.

135
00:13:22,730 --> 00:13:24,320
All I want is money.

136
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:25,660
Fine, alright.

137
00:13:25,684 --> 00:13:27,280
You seem like you could be useful.

138
00:13:27,304 --> 00:13:29,880
Hey, take this guy to the workshop.

139
00:13:35,149 --> 00:13:36,620
Well? Learned your lesson yet?

140
00:13:38,955 --> 00:13:40,420
Hey, this is crazy!

141
00:13:47,876 --> 00:13:52,066
X-Union isn't naive enough to trust you.

142
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:53,713
You can stay like that all night.

143
00:14:10,430 --> 00:14:12,873
This is just going too far!

144
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:15,473
I'm not listening to anything Sapphire says anymore!

145
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:21,180
Everyone! Poor people of Silverland!

146
00:14:21,400 --> 00:14:22,980
You have every right to be angry!

147
00:14:23,448 --> 00:14:25,293
Out of nowhere, Princess Sapphire declared

148
00:14:25,317 --> 00:14:28,713
she's tearing down the castle town in three days to build

149
00:14:28,737 --> 00:14:30,860
 a children's amusement park here.

150
00:14:30,884 --> 00:14:32,046
What's gotten into her?

151
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:37,032
But as long as Princess Sapphire's decree stands,

152
00:14:37,057 --> 00:14:39,120
we must obey her orders.

153
00:14:40,586 --> 00:14:42,246
What a terrible person Sapphire is!

154
00:14:44,629 --> 00:14:46,809
Nylon did a fine job.

155
00:14:46,833 --> 00:14:50,800
The gunpowder arrives this afternoon, and the town will be blown to bits.

156
00:14:51,339 --> 00:14:56,860
And X-Union storms into a desperate Silverland.

157
00:14:59,139 --> 00:15:00,140
Grand Duke Duralumin.

158
00:15:01,046 --> 00:15:03,360
Well, well, Your Majesty.

159
00:15:04,035 --> 00:15:08,113
Did Sapphire really order the town to be demolished?

160
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,503
Yes, that's right.

161
00:15:10,527 --> 00:15:14,195
Apparently, she refuses to leave until construction is finished and

162
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:16,360
she's been running all over the site.

163
00:15:18,613 --> 00:15:20,139
To think she'd do such a thing...

164
00:15:21,579 --> 00:15:22,929
I can't believe this.

165
00:15:22,953 --> 00:15:24,116
What could have happened?

166
00:15:24,140 --> 00:15:26,156
Sapphire, please hurry back...

167
00:15:26,180 --> 00:15:28,960
Someone! Someone open this door!

168
00:15:29,438 --> 00:15:30,880
Will Silverland be alright?

169
00:15:31,343 --> 00:15:32,043
Father,

170
00:15:32,667 --> 00:15:33,376
Mother,

171
00:15:33,773 --> 00:15:35,800
please forgive me for being so helpless.

172
00:15:42,346 --> 00:15:44,346
Open the undersea tunnel!

173
00:15:44,679 --> 00:15:48,693
Deliver the gunpowder to Silverland within the hour!

174
00:16:16,133 --> 00:16:17,133
Let's go!

175
00:16:21,063 --> 00:16:23,280
Silverland won't go down that easily!

176
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:49,673
Who threw dynamite into the room?

177
00:16:51,770 --> 00:16:53,346
Sapphire, are you okay?

178
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:57,140
Blood!

179
00:16:59,120 --> 00:17:00,303
You came to save me.

180
00:17:00,327 --> 00:17:01,296
Of course I did.

181
00:17:01,973 --> 00:17:03,580
Are you hurt, Sapphire?

182
00:17:06,799 --> 00:17:10,959
X-Union is about to blow Silverland to bits with dynamite!

183
00:17:11,174 --> 00:17:11,989
What?

184
00:17:12,013 --> 00:17:13,680
But how do we get out of here?

185
00:17:15,389 --> 00:17:16,599
Don't let Blood get away!

186
00:17:16,839 --> 00:17:18,680
Feed him to the sharks!

187
00:17:18,979 --> 00:17:21,026
Hurry up and search! Quick!

188
00:17:21,936 --> 00:17:22,960
Over here!

189
00:17:24,099 --> 00:17:24,976
Look, over there!

190
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,029
Sapphire is with him, too!

191
00:17:26,053 --> 00:17:26,619
Get them!

192
00:17:41,706 --> 00:17:46,896
So Blood was just putting on an act to uncover the X-Union's true motive!

193
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:50,213
That's right. He did it all for your sake.

194
00:17:51,059 --> 00:17:51,843
Listen, Sapphire!

195
00:17:51,867 --> 00:17:55,780
Take this cart straight to Silverland and stop the explosion!

196
00:17:57,339 --> 00:17:58,340
Blood, what about you?

197
00:17:58,719 --> 00:18:00,056
Don't worry about me.

198
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:02,340
Just save Silverland, alright?

199
00:18:03,849 --> 00:18:05,160
I'm sorry, Blood.

200
00:18:12,639 --> 00:18:14,703
What, you still haven't found them?

201
00:18:14,727 --> 00:18:16,020
Search! Search, hurry!

202
00:18:16,021 --> 00:18:17,420
Goll! Over here! Over here!

203
00:18:18,613 --> 00:18:19,340
Heads up!

204
00:18:20,709 --> 00:18:22,340
Hey, you so-called X-Union!

205
00:18:22,919 --> 00:18:25,660
I, the great Blood, am more than enough for the likes of you!

206
00:18:26,059 --> 00:18:29,426
I won't let you get your hands on Sapphire!

207
00:18:29,969 --> 00:18:31,600
Come on, bring it on!

208
00:18:33,909 --> 00:18:35,720
What are you doing?! Catch him, quick!

209
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:36,940
Go! Attack!

210
00:18:40,084 --> 00:18:42,613
Sapphire! Run! Hurry!

211
00:19:07,619 --> 00:19:09,660
Whoa, isn't that dynamite?!

212
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:12,206
Oh no! They're gonna blow up our houses with that!

213
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:26,480
Let me... Lord Nylon, the dynamite is all set.

214
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:30,760
Alright, soldiers! Light every last bit of gunpowder in town!

215
00:19:49,449 --> 00:19:51,280
Look! It's Sapphire!

216
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:54,760
Get her!

217
00:19:57,340 --> 00:19:58,340
Damn it!

218
00:20:03,069 --> 00:20:04,740
We have to hurry, or something terrible will happen!

219
00:20:30,019 --> 00:20:32,200
Ah! Sapphire is cutting the fuses!

220
00:20:32,554 --> 00:20:34,700
Wait, wasn't it Sapphire who gave the signal?!

221
00:20:34,964 --> 00:20:38,600
Huh? What? Sapphire... Sapphire is...

222
00:20:41,529 --> 00:20:44,073
Nylon! On whose orders did you do this?!

223
00:20:44,254 --> 00:20:48,060
Well, an official decree was issued in Lord Sapphire's name...

224
00:20:48,289 --> 00:20:49,580
A decree from me...?

225
00:20:49,829 --> 00:20:50,459
Sapphire!

226
00:20:50,870 --> 00:20:53,020
Looks like you managed to prevent the explosion!

227
00:20:53,839 --> 00:20:55,760
Blood! You're safe!

228
00:20:56,585 --> 00:20:57,564
Of course I am!

229
00:20:58,114 --> 00:20:58,819
Everyone!

230
00:20:59,450 --> 00:21:02,493
Setting the explosives was the work of the X-Union!

231
00:21:03,034 --> 00:21:06,233
Come on! Let's take down those X-Union bastards!

232
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:07,113
Get 'em!

233
00:21:07,369 --> 00:21:08,880
Hey!

234
00:21:09,894 --> 00:21:12,640
Lord Sapphire, what about me?

235
00:21:13,169 --> 00:21:15,600
Stay right there until your name is cleared!

236
00:21:16,435 --> 00:21:17,835
You can't be serious...

237
00:21:20,639 --> 00:21:21,639
We've got trouble!

238
00:21:36,719 --> 00:21:37,976
Wait! Wait! Wait!

239
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:38,949
Stop!

240
00:21:39,253 --> 00:21:40,720
Come back and fight!

241
00:21:40,984 --> 00:21:41,743
Damn it!

242
00:21:41,907 --> 00:21:43,160
They escaped in the cart!

243
00:21:56,236 --> 00:21:56,863
Damn it!

244
00:21:56,887 --> 00:21:58,833
What a pathetic bunch!

245
00:22:10,886 --> 00:22:11,539
Amazing!

246
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:14,160
Just look at it plow right into them, Sapphire!

247
00:22:15,799 --> 00:22:19,000
What on earth happened? I don't hear the explosions anymore.

248
00:22:19,146 --> 00:22:22,973
W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-What is this earthquake?!

249
00:22:35,321 --> 00:22:36,720
What was that earthquake just now?

250
00:22:36,744 --> 00:22:39,660
An underwater explosion sank the island.

251
00:22:39,685 --> 00:22:44,820
Oh, what a disaster! All our hard work, down the drain...

252
00:23:03,149 --> 00:23:04,149
Lord Sapphire!

253
00:23:05,066 --> 00:23:09,773
Thank you. Thanks to you, the town was spared from destruction.

254
00:23:10,144 --> 00:23:11,620
It's too early to celebrate.

255
00:23:12,244 --> 00:23:14,740
The X-Union is finally closing in on Silverland.

256
00:23:16,094 --> 00:23:17,147
But no matter what happens everyone,

257
00:23:17,171 --> 00:23:22,433
we must protect our nation, this beautiful Silverland!

258
00:23:22,944 --> 00:23:24,520
Let us all join forces!

259
00:23:44,509 --> 00:23:50,820
<i>Just as Sapphire predicted, the main force of the X-Union turned its dark fangs toward Silverland.</i>

260
00:24:22,981 --> 00:24:26,601
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

261
00:24:26,602 --> 00:24:29,962
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

262
00:24:29,963 --> 00:24:33,733
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

